{
  "id": 21,
  "name": "regret_cluster_lookahead",
  "intent": "Strengthens regret-driven priority with cluster-density lookahead. The 0.4 regret weight exceeds the seed's 0.3 to push earlier inclusion of nodes whose second-best insertion is significantly worse than their nearest, increasing the urgency signal. The 0.15 cluster_density coefficient provides mild preference for candidates embedded in dense unvisited neighborhoods, supporting cluster-based traversal without overpowering local distance. Hypothesis: regret identifies insertion urgency, while cluster_density rewards staying within coherent geometric groups, a hybrid complementary to distance.",
